            0.854,
            0.745,
            0.913
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Look at Fig. 12.13. It shows how one small change can lead to many others. For example, many plants in a pond start dying because of pollution. With fewer plants less oxygen will be"
